1. Make sure every file is in your current directory

FOR PURE TERMINAL
2. Type "g++ main.cpp Queue.cpp Stack.cpp -o program.exe" in terminal, this will create a new server.exe file
3. Type "./program" in your terminal. It will run

FOR WEB VERSION
2. Type "g++ -std=c++11 -pthread Server.cpp Queue.cpp Stack.cpp -o server -lws2_32 -lwsock32" in terminal, this will create a new server.exe file
3. Type "./server" in your terminal
4. Click or CTRL-Click on the website address that is shown or go to "http://localhost:8080/" in your browser
